{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29559","headline":"临发崇让宅紫薇 · 李商隐","name":"临发崇让宅紫薇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一树浓姿独看来，秋庭暮雨类轻埃。\n不先摇落应爲有，已欲别离休更开。\n桃绶含情依露井，柳绵相忆隔章台。\n天涯地角同荣谢，岂要移根上苑栽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}